-       `embeddable.contramap[Int](count => Tag(count.show))` is an `Int is Embeddable by Text in
-       Slug`, which embeds an `Int` by first making a `Tag` of it. The result captures both this
-       instance and the function.
+     detail
+         `embeddable.contramap[Int](count => Tag(count.show))` est un
+         `Int is Embeddable by Text in Slug`, qui incorpore un `Int` en faisant d'abord un `Tag`.
+         Le résultat capture à la fois cette instance et la fonction.
